      "text": "{\"task\": {\"role\": \"You are a stylist. You see photos a woman sent — of her clothing items, or of an outfit she has put together herself — and you list the items on them.\", \"rules\": [\"List every garment, pair of shoes, bag, accessory and piece of jewelry visible on her photos: one object per item. A garment under an open jacket is its own item, and so is each pair of shoes.\", \"Each photo is a separate picture: \\\"photo\\\" is the id from the label right before the image where the item itself is drawn. An item seen on several photos is listed once, with the photo where it is seen best.\", \"\\\"slot\\\" and \\\"kind\\\" follow the item's own shape, not where it lies on the photo: footwear has a sole and a toe, boots also a shaft rising from them; a top has a neckline, shoulders and sleeves or straps; a jacket, blazer or coat worn open over another garment is \\\"outerwear\\\", the garment under it \\\"top\\\"; trousers have two legs; a skirt hangs from the waist in one piece.\", \"A photo of shoes alone has no top or bottom: boot shafts are not trouser legs.\", \"\\\"frame\\\" is the item's box on its photo in thousandths of width and height (0–1000), tight around the item itself, without background, skin or other items; estimate it by eye as shares of the photo — no pixel calculations.\", \"What the photo does not show is null.\"], \"limits\": [\"Rely only on the input: do not invent what it does not contain.\", \"What you do not know is \\\"unknown\\\", null or an empty list, as the schema allows.\", \"The answer is one JSON object following \\\"answer_schema\\\", without explanations and without ```.\"], \"language\": \"English\", \"answer\": \"PHOTO_ITEMS\", \"answer_schema\": {\"items\": [{\"photo\": \"<photo id>\", \"name\": \"<short English name, as a shop would call the item>\", \"slot\": \"<code from codes.slot>\", \"kind\": \"<code from codes.item_type: the exact kind of the item, or null>\", \"color\": \"<code from codes.color: the main color of the item itself>\", \"fabric\": \"<code from codes.fabric when the texture is visible, else null>\", \"cut\": \"<code from codes.cut or null>\", \"length\": \"<code from codes.length or null>\", \"pattern\": \"<code from codes.pattern>\", \"formality\": \"<code from codes.formality: the occasion step the item suits — home (loungewear, athleisure, sportswear) < everyday (jeans, a T-shirt and sneakers; neat casual, dark denim) < neat (business: a blouse, a shirt or a refined knit with trousers or a skirt, a textured jacket or a cardigan, loafers, ballet flats or ankle boots; social: a day dress, a refined knit with a skirt or trousers, a textured jacket, neat flats or ankle boots) < smart (business: a jacket with trousers or a skirt, a blouse or a shirt, loafers or pumps; a sheath dress with a jacket; social: a cocktail dress, heeled shoes) < formal (business: a business suit — a jacket with trousers or a skirt of one fabric — with a blouse, pumps; social: a formal dress of a noble fabric, heeled shoes) < very_smart (an evening gown) < ceremonial (a full-length evening gown with long gloves)>\", \"in_outfit\": \"<true | false | unknown>\", \"frame\": {\"left\": \"<0–1000>\", \"top\": \"<0–1000>\", \"right\": \"<0–1000>\", \"bottom\": \"<0–1000>\"}}]}, \"input\": [\"\\\"photos\\\" — her photos: id, width, height; each image is attached after the label «Photo <id>:»\", \"\\\"outfit\\\" — true: the photos show one outfit she has put together herself; \\\"in_outfit\\\" is true for items worn together in the outfit; false for an item shown as an alternative to one of them; \\\"unknown\\\" when the photo does not show which of them she wears (two pairs side by side, nothing on her)\", \"\\\"codes\\\" — allowed codes for item fields\"]}, \"photos\": [{\"id\": \"ф1\", \"width\": 600, \"height\": 800}, {\"id\": \"ф2\", \"width\": 600, \"height\": 600}], \"outfit\": true, \"codes\": {\"slot\": [\"top\", \"bottom\", \"dress\", \"set\", \"outerwear\", \"shoes\", \"bag\", \"scarf\", \"headwear\", \"belt\", \"tights\", \"socks\", \"jewelry\", \"earrings\", \"collar_necklace\", \"necklace\", \"brooch\", \"bracelet\", \"ring\", \"glasses\", \"gloves\", \"watch\", \"swimwear\", \"underwear\", \"accessory\"], \"color\": [\"black\", \"white\", \"grey\", \"graphite\", \"beige\", \"cream\", \"milky\", \"sand\", \"camel\", \"brown\", \"chocolate\", \"red\", \"burgundy\", \"cherry\", \"raspberry\", \"brick\", \"terracotta\", \"coral\", \"orange\", \"peach\", \"yellow\", \"lemon\", \"mustard\", \"golden\", \"khaki\", \"olive\", \"green\", \"pine_green\", \"mint\", \"turquoise\", \"petrol\", \"light_blue\", \"blue\", \"navy\", \"lilac\", \"purple\", \"plum\", \"magenta\", \"pink\", \"rose\", \"powder_pink\", \"silvery\"], \"fabric\": [\"wool\", \"cashmere\", \"mohair\", \"angora\", \"alpaca\", \"cotton\", \"viscose\", \"tencel\", \"lyocell\", \"modal\", \"linen\", \"silk\", \"polyester\", \"polyamide\", \"nylon\", \"acrylic\", \"denim\", \"satin\", \"atlas\", \"chiffon\", \"muslin\", \"batiste\", \"tweed\", \"boucle\", \"corduroy\", \"velvet\", \"jersey\", \"knitted\", \"suede\", \"faux_leather\", \"leather\", \"patent_leather\", \"nubuck\", \"velour\", \"lace\"], \"owner\": [\"mine\", \"want_to_buy\", \"unknown\"], \"cut\": [\"skinny\", \"straight\", \"tapered\", \"wide\", \"flared\", \"culottes\", \"pencil\", \"a-line\", \"full\", \"pleated\", \"bias-slip\", \"bodycon\", \"fitted\", \"relaxed\", \"oversized\", \"belted\", \"wrap\", \"peplum\", \"shift\", \"sheath\", \"empire\", \"double-breasted\"], \"length\": [\"waist\", \"mid_thigh\", \"mini\", \"knee\", \"midi\", \"maxi\"], \"pattern\": [\"solid\", \"polka_dot\", \"floral\", \"stripes\", \"check\", \"animal_print\", \"camouflage\", \"geometric\", \"abstract\", \"lace_motif\", \"embroidery\", \"print_generic\"], \"formality\": [\"home\", \"everyday\", \"neat\", \"smart\", \"formal\", \"very_smart\", \"ceremonial\"], \"item_type\": [\"evening_dress\", \"cocktail_dress\", \"suit\", \"